                <pb facs="0309" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg203"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Egan</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October 28,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan is instructed to maintain his present position, and is authorized to
                    draw on the Department for money to meet the extra expense if needed.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
